{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"04647d3e8f44e649b6d73328cb40599132a398e7b6297ea6c2f76790eabfc589","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"众祭司啊，要听我的话！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家啊，要留心听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"王家啊，要侧耳而听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"审判要临到你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你们在米斯巴如网罗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他泊山如铺张的网。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些悖逆的人肆行杀戮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"罪孽极深；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我却斥责他们众人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲为我所知；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列不能向我隐藏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲哪，现在你行淫了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列被玷污了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿警告拜偶像的人"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"他们所行的使他们不能归向 神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因有淫心在他们里面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们也不认识耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的骄傲当面见证自己。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"故此，以色列和以法莲必因自己的罪孽跌倒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大也必与他们一同跌倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必牵着牛羊去寻求耶和华，却寻不见；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他已经转去离开他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们向耶和华行事诡诈，生了私子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到了月朔，他们与他们的地业必被吞灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["犹大和以色列的战争"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"你们当在基比亚吹角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在拉玛吹号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在伯·亚文吹出大声，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便雅悯哪，有仇敌在你后头！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在责罚的日子，以法莲必变为荒场；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在以色列支派中，指示将来必成的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大的首领如同挪移地界的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必将忿怒倒在他们身上，如水一般。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲因乐从人的命令，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就受欺压，被审判压碎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使以法莲如虫蛀之物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使犹大家如朽烂之木。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"以法莲见自己有病，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大见自己有伤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们就打发人往亚述去见耶雷布王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他却不能医治你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能治好你们的伤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必向以法莲如狮子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向犹大家如少壮狮子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必撕裂而去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要夺去，无人搭救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"我要回到原处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等他们自觉有罪","poem":1},{"noteId":12},{"text":"，寻求我面；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在急难的时候必切切寻求我。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":12,"caller":"-","text":"或译：承认己罪","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}